BACS had already reported SMS-blaster smishing in western Switzerland in September 2025, and Basel-Landschaft police arrested a suspect with a device in November 2025, so ebas.ch's May 2026 post is a later awareness note rather than the only Swiss source. On managed Android devices 2G is blocked with the DISALLOW_CELLULAR_2G restriction from API level 34, set by a device owner, not through the TelephonyManager call; the user-visible sign is the brief switch from 4G to 2G that BACS describes.
